Subject: [PATCH 21/33] prefill mmq tab: moe_mmq_tab.cuh carries ggml's MIT
 notice

The file mirrors parts of llama.cpp's ggml-cuda mmq.cuh; like the other
ggml-derived kernels (native_moe.cu etc.) it now includes the copyright and
permission notice the MIT license asks for. Comment only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/prefill/moe_mmq_tab.cuh | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/prefill/moe_mmq_tab.cuh b/src/prefill/moe_mmq_tab.cuh
index d348920a..3bd0742a 100644
--- a/src/prefill/moe_mmq_tab.cuh
+++ b/src/prefill/moe_mmq_tab.cuh
@@ -23,6 +23,27 @@
 // CMake turns STRATA_MMQ_TAB off unless the SHA-256 of mmq.cuh's mirrored region (mul_mat_q_process_tile through
 // mul_mat_q_case, which includes struct mmq_args) is one this copy was verified against; when the llama.cpp pin
 // moves, re-sync this file, re-run the test and record the new hash in CMakeLists.txt (_strata_mmq_tab_known).
